  "details": "Opening the action menu every time I want to use an expression can be very tedious. This way I'm forced to still use gestures for things I want to have quick access to. I would love to be able to bind actions to keys on the keyboard, or buttons on a controller.\nHotkeys to buttons and toggles would work like their respective items in the action menu without opening the menu itself.\nHotkeys to puppets would bring up the puppet menu without opening the action menu.\nHotkeys to submenus would act like a shortcut to that submenu.",
